}}
where $q: \tilde{\pi}^*(\wedge^{k+1}M_{L'} \boxtimes \mathcal{O}_{\PP}) \to \tilde{\pi}^*(\wedge^k M_L(-\Delta) \boxtimes \mathcal{O}_{\PP})$ is the projection. This diagram extends uniquely to $\widetilde{B}$, giving the claim. \end{proof}


